        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions GDP625SBR, Guadalupe Bamboo Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe realistic look of this Solid Brass Bamboo Door Pull was achieved by molding the perfect piece of real bamboo. After perfecting the master molds, the craftsman at First Impressions cast each piece from Solid Brass. Each door pull is hand finished in your choice of high-quality finishes. The Guadalupe Bamboo Door Pull is available in 17-3/4 inch lengths or 11-3/4 inch lengths and can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFirst Impressions also offers <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-bamboo-cabinet-pull-first-impressions-gdp625005sbr\"><b>Bamboo Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/small-bamboo-shower-door-pull-first-impressions-sd-gdp625005sbr\"><b>Bamboo Shower Door Handles</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions GDP625SBR Guadalupe Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GDP-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions GDP625SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>GDP625011SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.09\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>GDP625017SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 11-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.13\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Bamboo Door Pull",
                "description": "The realistic look of this Solid Brass Bamboo Door Pull was achieved by molding the perfect piece of real bamboo. After perfecting the master molds, the craftsman at First Impressions cast each piece from Solid Brass. Each door pull is hand finished in your choice of high-quality finishes. The Guadalupe Bamboo Door Pull is available in 17-3/4 inch lengths or 11-3/4 inch lengths and can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n",
